					<description><![CDATA[<p>Black Tyde is a premium choice, offering 150-day grain-fed pure Black Angus beef known for its exceptional marbling and rich flavor. This quality is a hallmark of Rangers Valley, a renowned producer located in the cool-climate New England tablelands of NSW.</p>
<p>Rangers Valley consistently delivers tender and flavorful wagyu and Angus beef, with their animals freely grazing in lush, green pastures.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong>How we work</strong></p>
