		<item>
		<title>Cape Grim Porterhouse (Striploin) Carton</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/cape-grim-porterhouse-striploin-carton/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/cape-grim-porterhouse-striploin-carton/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Rebel Meat Co.]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 18:57:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=9764</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Tasmania is world-renowned for its rugged wilderness, pristine beauty and landscape of vivid contrast.</p>
<p>Cape Grim in the far northwest corner, shaped by wild Southern Ocean swells, abundant rainfall has <a title="news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/8332473.stm" href="https://www.capegrimbeef.com.au/news_bbc_co_uk.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the cleanest air in the world</a>.</p>
<p>Our proud collective of beef farmers throughout Tasmania, King and Flinders Islands, have a commitment to ethical practices and are audited by a third-party.</p>
<p>They nurture the finest quality cattle, without harming the pristine environment.</p>
<p>Raised on rich pastures with nothing else added, Cape Grim Beef is hand-selected and rigorously graded, rewarding you with pure beef flavour – made by nature.</p>
<p><strong>How We Work</strong></p>
<p>We sell everything by the carton.</p>
<p>When you place an order with us, you'll receive a carton containing a single cut of meat. For instance, if you order porterhouse, you'll get 3 or 4 whole porterhouse steaks, each vacuum-packed and sealed within the carton.</p>
<p>The weight of each carton varies with each order, typically ranging from 12 to 18 kg. You'll only be charged for the exact weight you receive.</p>
<p>To place an order, a $50 deposit is required. Once the deposit is paid, a carton is selected for you, and we invoice you for the total amount based on the carton’s weight. Upon receiving full payment, we deliver your order.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>Cape Grim whole Porterhouse - $34.99/kg</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/cape-grim-porterhouse-striploin-carton/">Cape Grim Porterhouse (Striploin) Carton</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/cape-grim-porterhouse-striploin-carton/">Cape Grim Porterhouse (Striploin) Carton</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
