<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light et_had_animation">
<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
<p>At Jack’s Creek, we lead in every step from breeding to marketing premium beef. Our products showcase Australian grain-fed Wagyu and Black Angus cattle with pride.</p>
<p>Quality is our top priority. Our cattle are processed under contract at rigorously regulated facilities: Northern Co-Operative Meat Company Est. 239 and Australian Country Choice Est. 1620. These facilities adhere to stringent Australian quarantine regulations and BRC Global Quality Assurance Standards. These certifications ensure the highest standards of beef quality and safety, offering essential reassurance to our customers. <strong>Experience the tenderness, juiciness, and rich flavor of our beef with every bite!</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
